    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: 'Read by an insert such as Chroma: each voice''s velocity * release gain.
        While send < 1 the voice volume stays constant (a falling volume would reach
        Unity''s inaudible limit and cut the sound with a click), so the insert applies
        this itself.'
